  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third-Party Monitoring - Clear Global Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project ambitions to support FCDO, HARP IPs, and the affected populations of Northeast Nigeria by conducting a range of TPM activities that would ensure that the humanitarian programming within the HARP portfolio is carried out effectively, compliantly, and attuned towards the needs of affected populations, while promoting continuous learning through innovative best practises for the HARP programme, as well as the wider humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
